Ah, the questions are coming together rapidly! They're really taking shape.

223
00:18:12,024 --> 00:18:14,824
ん？全然出来上がってきた？
Huh? "Really taking shape"?

224
00:18:15,224 --> 00:18:17,524
わしも何て言った？
What did I even just say?

225
00:18:20,024 --> 00:18:23,024
声が大きい。あ、声が大きいがいいね。
