232
00:18:56,824 --> 00:19:01,024
あんまり…あんまりFPS…手紙を食べる、手紙…
Not really... Not really FPS... "Eats letters," letters...

233
00:19:02,524 --> 00:19:05,224
FPSが得意。
"Good at FPS."

234
00:19:05,524 --> 00:19:09,524
FPSが…好きとかにするか。
Or maybe "Likes FPS" instead?

235
00:19:09,824 --> 00:19:12,024
どこに入れよう。
Where should I put it?

236
00:19:12,024 --> 00:19:14,524
この辺に入れるか。
Maybe put it around here?

237
00:19:14,524 --> 00:19:18,824
FPSが好き。
"Likes FPS."

238
00:19:20,524 --> 00:19:23,024
ふむふむふむ。FPSが好き。
Mm-hmm. Likes FPS.

239
00:19:25,024 --> 00:19:26,024
よし。
All right.

240
00:19:26,224 --> 00:19:32,524
そしてあと幾つじゃ？1、2、3、4。あと4つ！あと4つ募集するのじゃ！
Now, how many are left? 1, 2, 3, 4. 4 left! I'm taking suggestions for the last 4!

241
00:19:33,024 --> 00:19:35,024
